Package: ooclock
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign TUI matrix clock, stopwatch, and pomodoro timer
 A matrix digital clock, stopwatch, and pomodoro timer written in pure openOODA, featuring negative-trust capability security, circadian lighting, mascot moods, and MCP stdio surface.
 negative-trust capability security, syntax highlighting via oote themes,
 line numbering, range windowing, and an MCP stdio surface.
